    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48535" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσπίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίσω</span>, 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῐῶ</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσπιέειν</span>
		v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			8.135
		</span></i>; 
			Dor.
		
		aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐθέσπιξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					15.63
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσπις</span>):—<i>prophesy,
				foretell</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.47
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1210
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1161
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί δὲ τεθέσπισται</span>;
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				388
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				35.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, c. acc., [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμοί,] οὓς ἐθεσπίσθη Μωυσῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.38
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of the
