				75b
			</span></i>, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				6.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				521.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Abydus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				1.12.3
			</span></i>
			<u>Intr.</u>
        </div>
